cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "LensKD: Dual-Projector Cross-Vocabulary Alignment with Entropy-Gated Adaptive Divergence for White-Box Knowledge Distillation"
abstract: >-
  A white-box knowledge distillation framework for distilling a 596M teacher
  into a 25.83M student across a 23x capacity gap and disjoint vocabularies.
  LensKD unifies teacher and student output spaces with twin projectors,
  identifies a projector-induced distribution flattening effect (teacher entropy
  rising from 1.33 to 7.33) and resolves it with a dual-path fusion of native
  and projected KL, and adds entropy-gated adaptive divergence plus a
  progressive on-policy schedule.
